  "description": "Allocation of resources without limits or throttling vulnerability in Apache Tomcat during HTTP upgrade in some circumstances lead to possible DoS.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0-M1 through 11.0.27, from 10.1.0-M1 through 10.1.61, from 9.0.41 through 9.0.123.\n\n\n\nThe following versions were EOL at the time the CVE was created but are known to be affected:\u00a0from 8.5.61 through 8.5.100.\u00a0Other unsupported versions may also be affected.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.29, 10.1.62 or 9.0.124, which fix the issue.\nNote: Tomcat 11.0.28 was not released",
